mature senescence (GO:0090403)\",\"BP: positive regulation of DNA-templated transcription (GO:0045893)\",\"BP: positive regulation of RNA polymerase II transcription preinitiation complex assembly (GO:0045899)\",\"BP: positive regulation of apoptotic process (GO:0043065)\",\"BP: positive regulation of cellular senescence (GO:2000774)\",\"BP: positive regulation of execution phase of apoptosis (GO:1900119)\",\"BP: positive regulation of gene expression (GO:0010628)\",\"BP: positive regulation of intrinsic apoptotic signaling pathway (GO:2001244)\",\"BP: positive regulation of miRNA transcription (GO:1902895)\",\"BP: positive regulation of programmed necrotic cell death (GO:0062100)\",\"BP: positive regulation of reactive oxygen species metabolic process (GO:2000379)\",\"BP: positive regulation of release of cytochrome c from mitochondria (GO:0090200)\",\"BP: positive regulation of thymocyte apoptotic process (GO:0070245)\",\"BP: positive regulation of transcription by RNA polymerase II (GO:0045944)\",\"BP: protein tetramerization (GO:0051262)\",\"BP: protein-containing complex assembly (GO:0065003)\",\"BP: regulation of DNA-templated transcription (GO:0006355)\",\"BP: regulation of apoptotic process (GO:0042981)\",\"BP: regulation of cell cycle (GO:0051726)\",\"BP: regulation of cell cycle G2/M phase transition (GO:1902749)\",\"BP: regulation of transcription by RNA polymerase II (GO:0006357)\",\"BP: replicative senescence (GO:0090399)\",\"BP: response to antibiotic (GO:0046677)\",\"BP: response to gamma radiation (GO:0010332)\",\"BP: signal transduction by p53 class mediator (GO:0072331)\",\"BP: transcription initiation-coupled chromatin remodeling (GO:0045815)\",\"BP: tumor necrosis factor-mediated signaling pathway (GO:0033209)\",\"BP: type II interferon-mediated signaling pathway (GO:0060333)\",\"BP: viral process (GO:0016032)\",\"CC: PML body (GO:0016605)\",\"CC: centrosome (GO:0005813)\",\"CC: chromatin (GO:0000785)\",\"CC: cytoplasm (GO:0005737)\",\"CC: cytosol (GO:0005829)\",\"CC: endoplasmic reticulum (GO:0005783)\",\"CC: mitochondrial matrix (GO:0005759)\",\"CC: mitochondrion (GO:0005739)\",\"CC: nuclear matrix (GO:0016363)\",\"CC: nucleolus (GO:0005730)\",\"CC: nucleoplasm (GO:0005654)\",\"CC: nucleus (GO:0005634)\",\"CC: protein-containing complex (GO:0032991)\",\"CC: transcription regulator complex (GO:0005667)\",\"CC: transcription repressor complex (GO:0017053)\"]','[\"P02340\"]','[\"Cellular tumor antigen p53\"]','[\"1: Evidence at protein level\"]','[\"Multifunctional transcription factor that induces cell cycle arrest, DNA repair or apoptosis upon binding to its target DNA sequence (PubMed:19556538, PubMed:20673990, PubMed:22726440). Acts as a tumor suppressor in many tumor types; induces growth arrest or apoptosis depending on the physiological circumstances and cell type. Negatively regulates cell division by controlling expression of a set of genes required for this process. One of the activated genes is an inhibitor of cyclin-dependent kinases. Apoptosis induction seems to be mediated either by stimulation of BAX and FAS antigen expression, or by repression of Bcl-2 expression. Its pro-apoptotic activity is activated via its interaction with PPP1R13B/ASPP1 or TP53BP2/ASPP2 (By similarity). However, this activity is inhibited when the interaction with PPP1R13B/ASPP1 or TP53BP2/ASPP2 is displaced by PPP1R13L/iASPP (By similarity). In cooperation with mitochondrial PPIF is involved in activating oxidative stress-induced necrosis; the function is largely independent of transcription. Prevents CDK7 kinase activity when associated to CAK complex in response to DNA damage, thus stopping cell cycle progression (By similarity). Induces the transcription of long intergenic non-coding RNA p21 (lincRNA-p21) and lincRNA-Mkln1. LincRNA-p21 participates in TP53-dependent transcriptional repression leading to apoptosis, but seems to have to effect on cell-cycle regulation. Regulates the circadian clock by repressing CLOCK-BMAL1-mediated transcriptional activation of PER2 (PubMed:24051492)\"]','[\"Cytoplasm\",\"Cytoplasm, cytoskeleton, microtubule organizing center, centrosome\",\"Endoplasmic reticulum\",\"Mitochondrion matrix\",\"Nucleus\",\"Nucleus, PML body\"]','[\"MF: 14-3-3 protein binding (GO:0071889)\",\"MF: ATP-dependent DNA/DNA annealing activity (GO:0036310)\",\"MF: DNA binding (GO:0003677)\",\"MF: DNA-binding transcription activator activity, RNA polymerase II-specific (GO:0001228)\",\"MF: DNA-binding transcription factor activity (GO:0003700)\",\"MF: DNA-binding transcription factor activity, RNA polymerase II-specific (GO:0000981)\",\"MF: DNA-binding transcription repressor activity, RNA polymerase II-specific (GO:0001227)\",\"MF: MDM2/MDM4 family protein binding (GO:0097371)\",\"MF: RNA polymerase II cis-regulatory region sequence-specific DNA binding (GO:0000978)\",\"MF: RNA polymerase II transcription regulatory region sequence-specific DNA binding (GO:0000977)\",\"MF: RNA polymerase II-specific DNA-binding transcription factor binding (GO:0061629)\",\"MF: TFIID-class transcription factor complex binding (GO:0001094)\",\"MF: chromatin binding (GO:0003682)\",\"MF: cis-regulatory region sequence-specific DNA binding (GO:0000987)\",\"MF: copper ion binding (GO:0005507)\",\"MF: core promoter sequence-specific DNA binding (GO:0001046)\",\"MF: disordered domain specific binding (GO:0097718)\",\"MF: enzyme binding (GO:0019899)\",\"MF: general transcription initiation factor binding (GO:0140296)\",\"MF: histone deacetylase binding (GO:0042826)\",\"MF: histone deacetylase regulator activity (GO:0035033)\",\"MF: identical protein binding (GO:0042802)\",\"MF: mRNA 3\'-UTR binding (GO:0003730)\",\"MF: molecular condensate scaffold activity (GO:0140693)\",\"MF: molecular function activator activity (GO:0140677)\",\"MF: p53 binding (GO:0002039)\",\"MF: promoter-specific chromatin binding (GO:1990841)\",\"MF: protease binding (GO:0002020)\",\"MF: protein heterodimerization activity 